contentText:
Takeoff ’s estate has resolved a long-running lawsuit that accused the late Migos rapper of raping a woman at a house party in 2020.

A trial had been scheduled to begin on Dec. 1 for the claims brought six years ago by an anonymous woman known only as Jane Doe. But a Thursday (Nov. 12) court filing, obtained by Billboard , states that the lawyers in the case are planning to file a dismissal. The parties said in a joint statement, “The matter is resolved.” No further details were provided. &nbsp;

